<h2>Testing and Maintaining Actions</h2>

<p>
    Always test your agents before sharing them:
</p>

<ol>
    <li><strong>Test from action zone</strong> – Run the agent from the page where it will appear</li>
    <li><strong>Test from Enhanced AI Chat</strong> – Try triggering it via chat to ensure it works there too</li>
    <li><strong>Review the results</strong> – Check that emails were sent correctly, pages opened, etc.</li>
    <li><strong>Verify field mapping</strong> – Ensure all template fields were filled with the right data</li>
    <li><strong>Test error scenarios</strong> – Try running with missing data to see how errors are handled</li>
</ol>

<p>
    <strong>Maintenance tips:</strong>
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Whenever you change the underlying email template or business rule, <strong>update the action mappings</strong> and republish the agent</li>
    <li>Review agent usage periodically to see if actions need adjustment</li>
    <li>Update actions when workflows change</li>
</ul>

